{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01529","headline":"琴曲歌辞 雉朝飞操 · 张祜","name":"琴曲歌辞 雉朝飞操","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝阳陇东泛暖景，双啄双飞双顾影。\n朱冠锦襦聊日整，漠漠雾中如衣褧。\n伤心卢女弦，七十老翁长独眠。\n雄飞在草雌在田，衷肠结愤气呵天。\n圣人在上心不偏，翁得女妻甚可怜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01529.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01529","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}